WEBVTT

00:01:35.670 --> 00:01:38.350
I remember everything now!

00:01:38.350 --> 00:01:46.670
I sealed my memories back then, because I didn't want him to take my memories of the Mermaid Princesses!

00:01:46.670 --> 00:01:50.760
Kaito... remembers everything.

00:01:51.090 --> 00:01:54.840
The person in front of me that I have to protect...

00:01:54.840 --> 00:01:58.820
...is you, Lucia!

00:01:58.820 --> 00:02:00.350
Kaito!

00:02:16.740 --> 00:02:18.450
Unsettled Heart

00:02:27.760 --> 00:02:32.530
{Goodness!}No way. You must have ran into Mikeru while you were in Hawaii.

00:02:39.350 --> 00:02:42.130
Why? Why is it?

00:02:42.130 --> 00:02:45.780
Why is it that I feel that you have something that normal people don't have?

00:02:45.780 --> 00:02:49.220
Now, open your mind to me.

00:02:49.710 --> 00:02:55.630
Show all your memories to me.

00:02:55.630 --> 00:03:00.450
I want to know everything you know!

00:03:02.670 --> 00:03:07.390
Lucia, I'm sorry for hurting your feelings {during this time.}all this time.

00:03:08.800 --> 00:03:11.270
You were also hurt as well, weren't you, Kaito?

00:03:11.270 --> 00:03:15.280
You sealed your memories for the sake of the mermaids.

00:03:15.890 --> 00:03:23.320
No. Even though I sealed my memories, it didn't stop what happened between you all and Mikeru.

00:03:23.320 --> 00:03:29.980
Oh no! You were able to remember {about }me. That alone makes me really happy.

00:03:30.820 --> 00:03:31.640
Lucia...

00:03:32.100 --> 00:03:32.990
Kaito...

00:03:48.690 --> 00:03:50.220
Don't go, Kaito!

00:03:50.220 --> 00:03:53.130
Even though you've recovered your memories, you can stay here as long as you want!

00:03:53.130 --> 00:03:56.850
No, I can't just have you both take care of me like this.

00:03:56.850 --> 00:03:58.840
{Isn't that fine with you,}But it's okay with you, isn't it, Onii-sama?

00:03:58.840 --> 00:04:03.130
Y-Yeah, of course. That is, if Kaito-kun {agrees to}wants it.

00:04:03.390 --> 00:04:05.760
Thank you very much, Rihito-san.

00:04:05.760 --> 00:04:09.030
{However,}There are some things that I need to think about alone, though.

00:04:09.030 --> 00:04:11.680
Kaito! Don't leave me all alone!

00:04:11.680 --> 00:04:12.450
Please!

00:04:12.450 --> 00:04:17.350
Mikaru, don't be so {willful}needy. You're causing trouble for Kaito-kun.

00:04:18.470 --> 00:04:20.030
I'm sorry, Mikaru.

00:04:25.390 --> 00:04:26.250
Mikaru!

00:04:26.250 --> 00:04:27.890
Hold it right there, Mikaru!

00:04:31.030 --> 00:04:33.090
I'm sorry, Rihito-san.

00:04:33.090 --> 00:04:35.360
You've taken care of me for so long.

00:04:35.360 --> 00:04:36.870
{Oh no! That's all right.}No, it's all right.

00:04:37.230 --> 00:04:40.650
You were always taking care of Mikaru.

00:04:40.650 --> 00:04:44.020
I'll try to get her to calm down later.

00:05:05.350 --> 00:05:08.160
How is Mikeru's condition?

00:05:08.160 --> 00:05:11.810
{It's not good.}He's not doing well. He's in even more pain.

00:05:11.810 --> 00:05:12.880
I see.

00:05:12.880 --> 00:05:16.530
Is there a way to relieve his pain a bit?

00:05:16.860 --> 00:05:24.290
If Mikeru can absorb someone else's life into his body, his pain can probably be relieved a bit.

00:05:24.290 --> 00:05:26.100
We can try that.

00:05:29.040 --> 00:05:31.540
Someone else's life, {eh}huh?

00:05:38.660 --> 00:05:40.720
Mari, are you a middle school student?

00:05:40.720 --> 00:05:44.140
Y-Yeah... I guess so.

00:05:44.140 --> 00:05:47.180
Hey, Mari. Do you have a boyfriend?

00:05:47.180 --> 00:05:49.220
How could I have one?

00:05:49.220 --> 00:05:52.180
Eh? How can you not have when you're so cute!?

00:05:52.180 --> 00:05:54.020
I'm... cute?

00:05:57.260 --> 00:05:59.920
{It's}That was the first time I had friends...

00:05:59.920 --> 00:06:00.960
Lucia-san!

00:06:00.960 --> 00:06:01.500
Huh?

00:06:01.500 --> 00:06:04.230
Lucia-san, where do you think you're going?

00:06:04.230 --> 00:06:07.700
Be quiet! I'm delivering a boxed lunch to Kaito!

00:06:08.060 --> 00:06:11.630
That penguin is the pet of the Mermaid Princesses.

00:06:12.170 --> 00:06:16.050
Could those girls be the Mermaid Princesses?

00:06:18.670 --> 00:06:19.620
Mimi!

00:06:20.330 --> 00:06:24.850
You've been going up to dry land a lot recently. Where {were}are you going?

00:06:24.850 --> 00:06:26.890
W-Well, that's...

00:06:28.880 --> 00:06:30.650
Sheshe, to tell you the truth...

00:06:33.420 --> 00:06:36.100
{So, Sheshe, Mimi... you were here.}So this is where you were, Sheshe and Mimi.

00:06:36.100 --> 00:06:40.830
I've brought you a present from Mikeru-sama. Hehe!

00:06:43.430 --> 00:06:47.460
Mikeru-sama still has high hopes for you two.

00:06:47.460 --> 00:06:51.370
Don't let his {high hope go to waste!}expectations be for nothing!

00:06:51.370 --> 00:06:54.630
Mimi, failure is not an option.

00:06:55.190 --> 00:06:56.880
Y-Yeah.

00:06:59.710 --> 00:07:02.030
Hehe! It'll be all right.

00:07:02.030 --> 00:07:07.470
That's because you'll become part of Mikeru-sama's power!

00:07:16.660 --> 00:07:17.400
Huh?

00:07:18.550 --> 00:07:19.260
Lucia!

00:07:19.260 --> 00:07:21.910
Kaito! Are you going surfing?

00:07:21.910 --> 00:07:23.670
I{'ve} brought you lunch.

00:09:01.320 --> 00:09:04.070
Kaito is finally back to his old self.

00:09:04.070 --> 00:09:05.500
Aren't you glad, Lucia?

00:09:05.500 --> 00:09:07.110
Kaito's remembered.

00:09:07.390 --> 00:09:08.160
Yeah.

00:09:32.860 --> 00:09:36.310
Mikeru-sama hasn't given up on us.

00:09:36.310 --> 00:09:39.850
I feel the pressure knowing that he still has high hopes for us.

00:09:39.850 --> 00:09:42.330
In any case, he's given us a ball of light.

00:09:42.330 --> 00:09:45.720
Now, all that's left is to capture the Mermaid Princesses.

00:09:50.340 --> 00:09:51.870
Mimi?

00:09:52.100 --> 00:09:54.220
What's wrong? You're out of it.

00:09:54.220 --> 00:09:55.350
Are you all right?

00:09:55.350 --> 00:09:56.900
Do you feel ill?

00:09:57.490 --> 00:09:58.590
Oh, it's nothing.

00:09:58.590 --> 00:10:00.090
Don't worry about it.

00:10:01.370 --> 00:10:04.890
So here's my battle plan to capture the Mermaid Princesses.

00:10:05.710 --> 00:10:08.720
This whistle is able to reproduce the sound that {a dolphin would generate.}dolphins make.

00:10:08.720 --> 00:10:10.630
The sound of a dolphin?

00:10:10.630 --> 00:10:11.450
That's right.

00:10:11.450 --> 00:10:15.350
If we use this to make a sound indicating that a dolphin is hurt and needs help,

00:10:15.350 --> 00:10:20.130
the Mermaid Princesses {can't}won't be able to ignore it since they understand {the words (language?) of the dolphins.}dolphin-speak.

00:10:20.130 --> 00:10:21.660
I see.

00:10:21.660 --> 00:10:24.340
{You get it?}Got it? This time, it's the end for {the Mermaid Princesses!}them!

00:10:39.270 --> 00:10:40.950
Oh... {I know, Lucia!}Hey, Lucia.

00:10:41.870 --> 00:10:42.660
Here.

00:10:52.870 --> 00:10:56.160
You left {the}your key behind at my place that time, didn't you?

00:10:56.600 --> 00:10:59.100
{Will}Could you come to my place to tidy it up?

00:10:59.100 --> 00:11:01.110
I'm no good at cleaning.

00:11:01.850 --> 00:11:03.100
Kaito...

00:11:03.590 --> 00:11:04.560
Okay!

00:11:25.560 --> 00:11:27.370
Now, let's begin!

00:11:27.370 --> 00:11:28.500
You ready, Mimi?

00:11:28.500 --> 00:11:29.850
Y-Yeah.

00:11:52.870 --> 00:11:54.300
What's wrong, Rina?

00:11:54.300 --> 00:11:56.900
Did you two hear something?

00:12:00.780 --> 00:12:03.640
I hear a dolphin calling for help!

00:12:03.640 --> 00:12:05.140
Let's take a look, Hanon!

00:12:05.140 --> 00:12:05.830
Okay.

00:12:07.420 --> 00:12:10.580
Where are you? We're here to help you, dolphin!

00:12:10.580 --> 00:12:14.080
What's wrong, dolphin? What happened?

00:12:14.080 --> 00:12:16.090
Where are you, dolphin?

00:12:19.740 --> 00:12:22.120
{You two, hold on a second.}Hold on a second, you two.

00:12:22.120 --> 00:12:23.770
What's wrong, Rina?

00:12:23.770 --> 00:12:27.600
Lucia, Hanon, don't you think it's a bit strange?

00:12:27.600 --> 00:12:28.110
Huh?

00:12:28.110 --> 00:12:29.850
Think about it.

00:12:29.850 --> 00:12:32.360
Dolphins don't come to the deeper part of the sea.

00:12:32.360 --> 00:12:35.130
Then, could this be a trap?

00:12:37.400 --> 00:12:40.920
It seems like you {found}figured it out too late, Mermaid Princesses.

00:12:41.230 --> 00:12:42.380
You...

00:12:42.380 --> 00:12:44.060
Black Beauty Sisters!

00:12:47.180 --> 00:12:50.280
T-That's the sound a dolphin makes to {request outside}call for help!

00:12:50.280 --> 00:12:54.880
It's so {dull}boring that you fell into such a simple trap.

00:12:54.880 --> 00:12:58.890
It's about time {this game is over!}we end this game.

00:12:58.890 --> 00:13:01.600
We don't want to play with you either.

00:13:01.600 --> 00:13:03.840
Hanon! Rina! Let's do it!

00:13:13.940 --> 00:13:15.760
Pink Pearl Voice!

00:13:20.210 --> 00:13:22.110
Aqua Pearl Voice!

00:13:26.480 --> 00:13:28.140
Green Pearl Voice!

00:13:33.170 --> 00:13:35.510
I'm not going to let you {just }sing!

00:13:36.230 --> 00:13:38.930
What's this light?

00:13:38.930 --> 00:13:40.750
It's so bright that we can't sing!

00:13:45.980 --> 00:13:46.720
Huh?

00:13:46.720 --> 00:13:48.550
We've turned back into mermaids!

00:13:48.550 --> 00:13:49.710
Why?

00:13:49.710 --> 00:13:54.960
So, how do you like the power from Mikeru-sama's ball of light?

00:13:54.960 --> 00:13:56.540
Let's do it, Mimi!

00:13:57.510 --> 00:13:59.300
What's wrong, Mimi?

00:14:01.110 --> 00:14:03.000
I got it, Sheshe.

00:14:03.000 --> 00:14:05.070
It's Show Time!

00:15:28.670 --> 00:15:30.840
This is the {real }end!

00:15:42.560 --> 00:15:46.000
The {dried up (?)}washed up Mermaid Princesses are blockheads, aren't they?

00:15:54.880 --> 00:15:57.200
You really get along with your older sister, don't you?

00:15:57.200 --> 00:16:00.210
You want your sister to respect your abilities, right?

00:16:00.210 --> 00:16:03.130
She'll understand how you feel.

00:16:03.870 --> 00:16:05.520
How {could}can that be?

00:16:05.520 --> 00:16:10.250
The first friends that I made are the Mermaid Princesses...

00:16:13.180 --> 00:16:14.760
Mimi? What's wrong?

00:16:14.760 --> 00:16:18.770
Just a little more and we can defeat the Mermaid Princesses!

00:16:19.310 --> 00:16:22.450
Sheshe, I... I...

00:16:23.410 --> 00:16:24.460
Mimi?

00:16:32.300 --> 00:16:34.410
W-We've been saved...

00:16:34.410 --> 00:16:36.410
What happened?

00:16:36.410 --> 00:16:38.910
Did something happen to them?

00:16:49.680 --> 00:16:51.870
What in the world happened, Mimi?

00:16:51.870 --> 00:16:54.930
This was a good chance for us to repay Mikeru-sama.

00:16:56.360 --> 00:16:58.120
What happened, Mimi?

00:16:59.420 --> 00:17:02.230
I'm sorry, Sheshe.

00:17:02.230 --> 00:17:05.420
I can't... fight them!

00:17:06.160 --> 00:17:07.110
Mimi!

00:17:09.290 --> 00:17:11.270
{Hehe! }I knew you'd fail!

00:17:11.270 --> 00:17:16.290
Oh well. We never {had}put much hope {for}on you two {in the beginning.}anyway.

00:17:16.730 --> 00:17:18.030
What did you say!?

00:17:18.030 --> 00:17:20.480
Hold it! What are you talking about!?

00:17:20.480 --> 00:17:25.180
In any case, you're going to be sacrificed and absorbed into Mikeru-sama's body.

00:17:25.180 --> 00:17:27.270
Absorbed into Mikeru-sama?

00:17:27.270 --> 00:17:28.750
{Garbage?}Sacrificed?

00:17:42.630 --> 00:17:44.750
Wait, Mikeru-sama!

00:17:44.750 --> 00:17:47.100
It's my fault.

00:17:47.100 --> 00:17:51.920
If I didn't run away, we would've won the fight!

00:17:51.920 --> 00:17:52.890
Mimi.

00:17:52.890 --> 00:17:57.510
So just punish me instead!

00:17:57.890 --> 00:18:00.850
Please! Sheshe is not at fault!

00:18:00.850 --> 00:18:02.440
Please forgive her!

00:18:02.610 --> 00:18:03.970
Mikeru-sama!

00:18:03.970 --> 00:18:06.310
That's enough, Mimi!

00:18:07.030 --> 00:18:08.410
Sheshe...

00:18:08.410 --> 00:18:13.890
We don't need to sacrifice our lives if they just see us as {garbage}disposable.

00:18:13.910 --> 00:18:20.730
Even though we won't win, we'll show him the power of the Black Beauty Sisters!

00:18:23.460 --> 00:18:24.790
Sheshe...

00:18:26.250 --> 00:18:27.750
It's Show Time!

00:19:21.750 --> 00:19:24.100
Sheshe, I...

00:19:24.100 --> 00:19:27.270
I'm the happiest when I sing with you, Sheshe.

00:19:27.650 --> 00:19:30.720
Mimi, I'm the same way.

00:19:31.120 --> 00:19:32.400
Sheshe!

00:19:32.400 --> 00:19:33.370
Mimi!

00:19:33.370 --> 00:19:35.660
We'll be together forever!

00:19:36.050 --> 00:19:37.880
By the way, Sheshe...

00:19:37.880 --> 00:19:42.200
If we're reborn, I've got some friends I want to introduce you to.

00:19:42.200 --> 00:19:47.150
My goodness, Mimi! When did you make friends like that?

00:19:48.300 --> 00:19:51.560
You'll definitely be surprised, Sheshe...

00:19:52.560 --> 00:19:54.750
I'll be looking forward to it!

00:20:04.450 --> 00:20:07.360
Mikeru-sama, do you feel better?

00:20:08.510 --> 00:20:09.860
This is getting scary.

00:20:09.860 --> 00:20:13.840
I never knew that I had to do something like this in order to maintain this body...

00:20:14.710 --> 00:20:16.220
Mikeru-sama?

00:20:16.420 --> 00:20:19.280
Mikeru-sama!

00:21:35.150 --> 00:21:38.180
Is Mikaru really feeling that ill?

00:21:38.180 --> 00:21:42.600
Yeah. I figured that if you were here, she would feel better.

00:21:43.680 --> 00:21:47.120
Kaito, you came! I'm so happy!

00:21:47.630 --> 00:21:48.910
Mikaru!

00:21:48.910 --> 00:21:51.150
Are you all right? {Are you able to get up?}Are you sure you should be up?

00:21:51.150 --> 00:21:54.570
I'm fine, Onii-sama! I'm completely better!

00:21:54.570 --> 00:21:59.290
Besides, Kaito took the time to see me. It would be a waste to be lying in bed!

00:21:59.290 --> 00:22:00.930
Right, Kaito?

00:22:02.200 --> 00:22:03.250
Y-Yeah...

00:22:03.250 --> 00:22:04.480
Hey, Onii-sama.

00:22:04.480 --> 00:22:08.280
Since the three of us are together, let's go and eat something good!

00:22:08.280 --> 00:22:09.300
Please? Pretty please?

00:22:09.300 --> 00:22:11.060
Uhh... I guess so...

00:22:11.060 --> 00:22:12.510
Yay!

00:22:12.510 --> 00:22:14.660
I love you, Onii-sama!

00:23:51.050 --> 00:23:52.660
Kaito, don't go!

00:23:52.660 --> 00:23:54.500
Don't {return}go back to Lucia!

00:23:54.500 --> 00:23:55.130
Mikaru...

00:23:55.130 --> 00:23:57.430
I'll make the delicious food that Lucia makes for you every day!

00:23:57.430 --> 00:23:59.060
Please, don't go!

00:23:59.060 --> 00:24:01.740
If you leave me behind, I'll die!

00:24:01.740 --> 00:24:06.240
Mikaru, will you really be happy keeping me like this?

00:24:06.240 --> 00:24:07.770
Yeah. I'll be happy.

00:24:07.770 --> 00:24:11.520
That's because we'll be together, no matter what, Kaito.

00:24:11.520 --> 00:24:14.490
Next time on Mermaid Melody Pichi Pichi Pitch Pure:

00:24:14.490 --> 00:24:16.050
The Allure of the White Feather.

00:24:16.050 --> 00:24:19.390
I'm not going to be separated from you, Kaito!
